### ==============================================================================
### FASE 3b: REST API CLIENT (PERMINTAAN BARANG BARU & PENENTUAN COA)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai PIC Unit 1 (Rina)
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Buat Draft Permintaan Barang Baru (PIC Unit 1, Dokumen ID 1)
# @name createDraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/new-item-requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Stetoskop Digital AI Pro",
  "spec": "Bluetooth 5.0, Noise cancelling 40dB",
  "uom": "Unit",
  "qty": 2,
  "est_price": 3500000,
  "reason": "Kebutuhan upgrade alat diagnosa poli MCU"
}

###
@requestId = {{createDraft.response.body.data.id}}

### 4. Lihat Daftar Permintaan Barang Baru pada Dokumen Anggaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/new-item-requests
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Ubah Draft Permintaan Barang Baru (Hanya saat status DRAFT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/new-item-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Stetoskop Digital AI Pro Max",
  "spec": "Bluetooth 5.2, Noise cancelling 45dB",
  "uom": "Unit",
  "qty": 3,
  "est_price": 3600000,
  "reason": "Revisi spek dari dokter spesialis MCU"
}

### 6. Kirim Permintaan ke Akuntansi (DRAFT -> MENUNGGU_COA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/new-item-requests/send
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "request_ids": [{{requestId}}]
}

### 7. Login sebagai Akuntansi (Dya Putri)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 8. Lihat Antrean Penentuan COA Barang Baru (Khusus Akuntansi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/new-item-requests/queue?status=MENUNGGU_COA
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Akuntansi Menentukan COA & Menambahkan Barang ke Master (BR-17 & BR-18)
POST {{baseUrl}}/new-item-requests/{{requestId}}/assign-coa
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "coa_id": 1,
  "item_code": "BRG-STET-001",
  "price": 3600000
}
